{"seq":3,"slug":"portfolio-construction","title":"组合构建","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/portfolio-construction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mean-variance-optimization","title":"均值方差优化与改进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/portfolio-construction/mean-variance-optimization","wordCount":2357,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"risk-parity","title":"风险平价与层次风险平价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/portfolio-construction/risk-parity","wordCount":2170,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"portfolio-constraints","title":"组合约束与交易成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/portfolio-construction/portfolio-constraints","wordCount":2041,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"# 组合构建\n\n本章讨论如何将因子信号转化为实际可持有的投资组合。从 Markowitz 均值方差优化的经典框架出发，分析其在高维场景下的失效及各种改进方案；然后介绍风险平价与层次风险平价等不依赖期望收益估计的替代方法；最后讨论实际组合管理中不可避免的约束条件和交易成本处理。三篇文档完成\"因子信号 → 目标权重 → 实际持仓\"的全链条覆盖。\n"}